A wise man once told me the following

#quote(block: true, attribution: [DaClemens (translated)])[
  For 10x developers, the experience counts x10. They do 10x of the work after all.

  $=>$ 3 years as a 10x developer = 30 years of experience.

  And suddenly all the anachronisms add up.
]

For posterity, here's the original German quote.

#quote(block: true, attribution: [DaClemens])[
  Für 10x developer zählt auch experience x10. Die machen ja schließlich 10x work.

  $=>$ 3 Jahre 10x developer sein = 30 Jahre experience. Und plötzlich machen all diese Anachronismen Sinn.
]

